+=thumb
AH=artificial harmonic
^f=full bend
^h=half bend
/ or  = slide
T=right hand tapping
(T)=left hand tapping
2(14) = fret the number on the left and play the harmonic on the right by
tapped harm.
technique.
X = pick slide
X = muffled strings
~~~~ = vibrato

